shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VeJP0FaL-UzzChca5f0bkA","review_id":"sjF8P_5b6qarkiKe0HQ7Ng","date":"2015-01-20T21:44:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430885314941406,"text_excerpt":"Cool little store where you can buy spices, spice blends, and loose teas. I smelled quite a few of the spices (it's encouraged) and they all seemed fresh. The teas looked good too. I'm kicking myself because I didn't have time to buy some of their rose mint herbal tea. Good spot for foodie gifts :-)"},{"business_id":"VeJP0FaL-UzzChca5f0bkA","review_id":"4O_IgUml2xw8pyAkiloMbQ","date":"2019-03-17T01:04:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9293273687362671,"text_excerpt":"They have so many different tea blends and spices! It's really nice that you are able to smell everything before making a choice. They also sell small samples that they put together if your indecisive. Prices were very fair for the area as well. Be sure to get your yelp check in offer too!"},{"business_id":"VeJP0FaL-UzzChca5f0bkA","review_id":"qfHpwfLYPxOBrV8FQtvfOA","date":"2019-08-03T22:16:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9271419048309326,"text_excerpt":"In my search for a spice shop, I found this store on Yelp and was extremely pleased with their selection of teas and spices. I bought some seafood creole and habanero spice. When you make your selection, the attendants help package the spices in bottles and seal them right in front of you. It was fun to watch. I made some Salmon and Tilapia with the seafood spice and I loved it. I definitely recommend here!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VeJP0FaL-UzzChca5f0bkA","photo_id":"DdMWUkn19oi4vrIq2JPL8w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/DdMWUkn19oi4vrIq2JPL8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9149216413497925},{"business_id":"VeJP0FaL-UzzChca5f0bkA","photo_id":"hqJ6wTxyzBPxoZkuH3EMqA","label":"out